Amiga Machine Code Course (amcc)
--------------------------------

Here you can find all the assembly code files from
the danish data school letters.

http://palbo.dk/dataskolen/maskinsprog/

and additional a complete german translation from
the impressive Mark Wrobel Amiga Machine Code Course

https://www.markwrobel.dk/project/amigamachinecode/ 

Big Thanks to the authors!


